<title>USA: Global TeleMedia closes Log On America buy.</title>
<headline>Global TeleMedia closes Log On America buy.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global TeleMedia International Inc said on Friday it completed the asset purchase of Log On America Inc, an Internet service provider.</p>
<p>Log On America specializes in providing a full range of Internet solutions to large commercial accounts.</p>
<p>Roderick McClain, GTMI's chairman and chief executive, said the acquisition of Log On America helps the company serve as a &quot;one stop&quot; full service telecommunications company.</p>
</text>
